  "isDnd":false,
  "layers":[
    {"$GMRAssetLayer":"","%Name":"Instructions","assets":[
        {"$GMRSpriteGraphic":"v1","%Name":"graphic_3F84B0F7","animationSpeed":1.0,"colour":4294967295,"frozen":false,"headPosition":0.0,"ignore":false,"inheritedItemId":null,"inheritItemSettings":false,"name":"graphic_3F84B0F7","resourceType":"GMRSpriteGraphic","resourceVersion":"2.0","rotation":0.0,"scaleX":64.0,"scaleY":36.0,"spriteId":{"name":"spr_InfoOverlay","path":"sprites/spr_InfoOverlay/spr_InfoOverlay.yy",},"x":0.0,"y":0.0,},
        {"$GMRTextItem":"v3","%Name":"text_A585DCE","alignment":0,"charSpacing":0.0,"colour":4294967295,"fontId":{"name":"fnt_Info","path":"fonts/fnt_Info/fnt_Info.yy",},"frameH":620.0,"frameW":1240.0,"frozen":false,"ignore":false,"inheritedItemId":null,"inheritItemSettings":false,"lineSpacing":5.0,"name":"text_A585DCE","paragraphSpacing":0.0,"resourceType":"GMRTextItem","resourceVersion":"2.0","rotation":0.0,"scaleX":1.0,"scaleY":1.0,"text":"This demonstration showcases the CIMPLI providers functionality.\r\nProviders can be used for delivering requested values (dependencies) to other components, according to the kind of value and optional parameterisation.\r\nThe component is not concerned with how its dependency is resolved; it's up to the provider to produce or find the required value. In particular, the provider may determine one value kind needs to have new instances created every time, while other value kind may reuse a shared value.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\nIn this example, you can choose the shape to place, as well as its size and colour\r\nWhen you left-click on the area to the right, the instance of the given shape will be placed.\r\nWhen you right-click on an existing shape, it will be removed.\r\n\r\nThe shapes are resolved in the following ways:\r\n- Round: creates a new instance with a given size and colour, with no rotation\r\n- Square: creates a new instance with a given size and colour, as well as a random rotation\r\n- Triangle: creates a new instance with a given size and colour, as well as a random rotation\r\n- Star: takes the existing instance and moves it to the given spot; neither colour, size nor rotation is affected\r\n\r\nUnder the hood, the shape determines the value kind, while the size and colour are arguments. Among different value kinds a substantially different resolution logic is used:\r\n- squares and triangles apply the given size and colour together with a random rotation\r\n- rounds apply only the given size and colour\r\n- the star takes an existing instance and ignores the size and colour altogether","wrap":true,"x":20.0,"y":80.0,},
        {"$GMRTextItem":"v3","%Name":"text_19E0A535","alignment":0,"charSpacing":0.0,"colour":4292149119,"fontId":{"name":"fnt_Title","path":"fonts/fnt_Title/fnt_Title.yy",},"frameH":40.0,"frameW":800.0,"frozen":false,"ignore":false,"inheritedItemId":null,"inheritItemSettings":false,"lineSpacing":5.0,"name":"text_19E0A535","paragraphSpacing":0.0,"resourceType":"GMRTextItem","resourceVersion":"2.0","rotation":0.0,"scaleX":1.0,"scaleY":1.0,"text":"SHAPE MAKER DEMO","wrap":true,"x":20.0,"y":20.0,},
      ],"depth":0,"effectEnabled":true,"effectType":null,"gridX":20,"gridY":20,"hierarchyFrozen":false,"inheritLayerDepth":false,"inheritLayerSettings":false,"inheritSubLayers":true,"inheritVisibility":true,"layers":[],"name":"Instructions","properties":[],"resourceType":"GMRAssetLayer","resourceVersion":"2.0","userdefinedDepth":false,"visible":false,},
